+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+This project's current recorded decision is to use Argon2id for hashing and storing user passwords, chosen for its memory-hard design and configurable time cost, memory cost, and parallelism parameters, which give it stronger resistance to GPU- and ASIC-based brute-force attacks than earlier alternatives.
